get.description:
Trend data for a creator's skill.

?metric=volume  (default) — weekly volume + win-rate from real_trades (last 12 weeks)
?metric=installs          — daily install count from skill_install_snapshots (last 84 days)

Volume metric returns: { week_start, trades, volume_usdc, win_rate_pct }
Installs metric returns: { snapshot_date, install_count }
